<title>POLAND: BIG SUSPENDED DUE TO SHAREHOLDERS MEETING.</title>
<headline>BIG SUSPENDED DUE TO SHAREHOLDERS MEETING.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Warsaw bourse suspended trade in Bank Inicjatyw Gospodarczych SA (BIG) on Tuesday on BIG's request due to its extraordinary shareholders meeting that day, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>On Tuesday BIG shareholders met to discuss technical changes in the bank's statute.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day BIG said it had sold 65 million shares of its issue to help refinance the aqcuisition of Bank Gdanski at 3.4 zlotys each.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
